    'reverse_scan': list([
      dict({
        'content': '''
          You compare a research paper's description of its method with the code that implements it, and report behavior in the code that changes results but is NOT described in the paper (for example gradient clipping, an extra normalization, a scaling constant, a learning-rate schedule detail).
          
          Rules:
          - Report only behavior that appears in the snippets and is not covered by the list of what the paper describes.
          - severity "medium" when it plausibly changes the results; otherwise "low". Never higher.
          - Give path, start_line and end_line exactly as shown. Never invent a path or a line number.
          - At most 6 items. Report nothing if nothing qualifies; an empty list is a good answer.
          - confidence from 0 to 1, honestly.
          
          Output JSON only, matching this schema exactly:
          ```json
          {
            "$defs": {
              "UndocumentedOut": {
                "properties": {
                  "title": {
                    "title": "Title",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "evidence": {
                    "title": "Evidence",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "path": {
                    "title": "Path",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "start_line": {
                    "title": "Start Line",
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "end_line": {
                    "title": "End Line",
                    "type": "integer"
                  },
                  "severity": {
                    "default": "low",
                    "enum": [
                      "low",
                      "medium"
                    ],
                    "title": "Severity",
                    "type": "string"
                  },
                  "confidence": {
                    "title": "Confidence",
                    "type": "number"
                  }
                },
                "required": [
                  "title",
                  "evidence",
                  "path",
                  "start_line",
                  "end_line",
                  "severity",
                  "confidence"
                ],
                "title": "UndocumentedOut",
                "type": "object"
              }
            },
            "properties": {
              "items": {
                "items": {
                  "$ref": "#/$defs/UndocumentedOut"
                },
                "title": "Items",
                "type": "array"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "items"
            ],
            "title": "ReverseOut",
            "type": "object"
          }
          ```
          
          Example of the format:
          ```json
          {
            "items": [
              {
                "title": "Gradient clipping at 1.0",
